cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Same Answer, Fewer Words: brevity and unsignalled locale inference in language model responses to English dialects"
abstract: >-
  Matched-pair study of three large language models answering the same question
  in Standard American English and in an English dialect. 52 base items, 936
  independent API calls, three repeats per prompt. Finds shorter responses at
  unchanged accuracy on jurisdiction-free items, and unsignalled locale
  inference on items whose correct answer depends on jurisdiction.
type: dataset
